{"vid":"nzf-nP69aeg","source":"nzf-nP69aeg.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":10.1,"txt":"If you have good coordination and"},{"t":11.8,"txt":"strength, are good at visualizing things"},{"t":13.9,"txt":"from drawings or plans, and like to"},{"t":16,"txt":"troubleshoot, you might be interested in"},{"t":18.1,"txt":"becoming a milright. Milrightes install"},{"t":20.9,"txt":"and maintain stationary industrial"},{"t":23,"txt":"machinery and mechanical equipment. They"},{"t":25.5,"txt":"may work in factories, production"},{"t":27.5,"txt":"plants, or recreational facilities. We"},{"t":30.2,"txt":"talked to a milright to find out more."},{"t":33.2,"txt":"I'm Benjamin Cosman. I'm a milright. A"},{"t":35.6,"txt":"milright's a rotating equipment"},{"t":37.3,"txt":"specialist. They can work on conveyor"},{"t":39.3,"txt":"belts, compressors, centrifugal pumps,"},{"t":41.7,"txt":"anything that rotates basically. Um, we"},{"t":44.7,"txt":"we deal with a lot of"},{"t":46.6,"txt":"bearings and mechanical seals. I was uh"},{"t":50.5,"txt":"I started the RAP program in high"},{"t":52.3,"txt":"school. Uh the registered apprentice"},{"t":54.6,"txt":"program is what it's called. Um you go"},{"t":57.3,"txt":"to school for half a day and then I"},{"t":59.5,"txt":"would go out to Imperial Oil for half a"},{"t":62.5,"txt":"day. And uh yeah, that's it was a good"},{"t":66.6,"txt":"way to start my trade. And then when I"},{"t":69.1,"txt":"graduated, I moved on to Foster Creek in"},{"t":71.7,"txt":"Canada in Cold Lake, Alberta. And I"},{"t":73.8,"txt":"worked there for about two years in my"},{"t":76.2,"txt":"apprenticeship. And then I moved to the"},{"t":78.5,"txt":"city because I wanted to see the other"},{"t":80.8,"txt":"side of my milright trade. Lots of stuff"},{"t":83.2,"txt":"in like the live industry. You uh you"},{"t":85.9,"txt":"rip and replace and I wanted to see kind"},{"t":88.2,"txt":"of the rebuilding aspect of my job. So"},{"t":91.2,"txt":"uh I came to the city and ended up"},{"t":92.9,"txt":"getting into the compressor industry. I"},{"t":95.4,"txt":"was originally interested in being a"},{"t":97.4,"txt":"milright because I was I liked mechanics"},{"t":100.6,"txt":"but I didn't want to work on"},{"t":101.9,"txt":"automobiles. So, I kind of found that"},{"t":105,"txt":"this trade would be kind of right down"},{"t":107.8,"txt":"my alley because you get to learn"},{"t":109.8,"txt":"everything to do mechanically and it's"},{"t":112.6,"txt":"not just on a certain thing. To become a"},{"t":116,"txt":"milright, you need to complete four"},{"t":118.4,"txt":"years of apprenticeship training. 10"},{"t":121,"txt":"months of it is on the job, two months"},{"t":123,"txt":"of it is in school for four consecutive"},{"t":125.6,"txt":"years."},{"t":127.1,"txt":"The preventative maintenance part of"},{"t":128.9,"txt":"being a milright is probably the most"},{"t":131,"txt":"important because if you let a machine"},{"t":133.4,"txt":"run without anybody taking care of it"},{"t":135.4,"txt":"when it breaks down, it's going to be a"},{"t":137,"txt":"lot more of a breakdown than if you were"},{"t":139.2,"txt":"paying attention to it, doing its"},{"t":140.7,"txt":"regular maintenance, changing the oil,"},{"t":143,"txt":"greasing the bearings, whatever you have"},{"t":144.5,"txt":"to do to it to keep it running. Your"},{"t":146.3,"txt":"days are very random in my job. I uh I"},{"t":150.2,"txt":"never know what to expect. The work"},{"t":152.2,"txt":"locations for Millerite, they can vary"},{"t":154.9,"txt":"from outside to"},{"t":158,"txt":"indoors, you can even do pumps that are"},{"t":160.2,"txt":"underwater. Um, in my specific job, I'm"},{"t":165.3,"txt":"the field service mill, right? So, I'm"},{"t":168.1,"txt":"all over over northern Alberta. A lot of"},{"t":170.9,"txt":"outdoor stuff. Being a milright, there's"},{"t":175,"txt":"a lot of safety that you have to pay"},{"t":176.9,"txt":"attention to. Most most machinery have"},{"t":179.5,"txt":"emergency stops on them that you always"},{"t":181.4,"txt":"want to be pushed in before you work on"},{"t":183.9,"txt":"anything or close it lock it out"},{"t":186.4,"txt":"electrically. PPE that you need to"},{"t":189.2,"txt":"wear. Uh fire retardant coveralls, steel"},{"t":192.2,"txt":"toe boots, hard hat, safety glasses, and"},{"t":195.3,"txt":"Kevlar gloves. Being a service guy, I"},{"t":198.6,"txt":"have a van full of tools."},{"t":201.6,"txt":"um all wrenches and sockets and pipe"},{"t":204.7,"txt":"wrenches and oil filter"},{"t":208.2,"txt":"wrenches, pretty much anything that you"},{"t":210.4,"txt":"can use. And our professional end of the"},{"t":213,"txt":"mil rights were maintenance mill rights."},{"t":215.3,"txt":"So, we're in a customer's face all the"},{"t":217.2,"txt":"time. We're not just locked up behind a"},{"t":219.4,"txt":"dirty old machine cleaning something"},{"t":221.6,"txt":"that's broken. We're in the face of the"},{"t":223.9,"txt":"public and in the face of customers. So,"},{"t":225.7,"txt":"the first thing I look for with the guys"},{"t":227.4,"txt":"I hire is what did you learn at home and"},{"t":230.1,"txt":"what can you bring to me because those"},{"t":231.6,"txt":"are the things I can't teach you. You"},{"t":234.3,"txt":"need to be mechanically inclined. Um,"},{"t":237,"txt":"you need to have patience"},{"t":239.9,"txt":"because pumps don't just build"},{"t":241.9,"txt":"themselves. And when you're dealing with"},{"t":243.5,"txt":"clearances like we do, it's I mean it's"},{"t":247,"txt":"close tolerances. So, I mean a hair is"},{"t":251.2,"txt":"could be make or break a pump. But a lot"},{"t":254.1,"txt":"of milrightes they go to planning. They"},{"t":257.1,"txt":"can become milright planners. They plan"},{"t":258.8,"txt":"the jobs that you go and do. But uh"},{"t":261.3,"txt":"being a milright, it gets your foot in"},{"t":263,"txt":"the door for all trades cuz you touch on"},{"t":264.9,"txt":"every trade while you're in the milright"},{"t":267.7,"txt":"trade. Most satisfying part of my job is"},{"t":270.5,"txt":"when you when you rebuild something from"},{"t":273.6,"txt":"tearing it right down to rebuilding it"},{"t":275.9,"txt":"and it runs after. That always seems to"},{"t":278,"txt":"put a smile on my face. someone that"},{"t":280.8,"txt":"would want to pursue this trade, I'd uh"},{"t":283.7,"txt":"I'd definitely recommend it. It uh it"},{"t":287.4,"txt":"really shows you a lot with mechanics."},{"t":290.7,"txt":"You get to see a lot. My job allows me"},{"t":294,"txt":"quite a bit of free time on the"},{"t":296,"txt":"weekends. Not a whole lot during the"},{"t":297.5,"txt":"week, but uh on the weekends, I like to"},{"t":299.8,"txt":"golf a lot. I'm happy with the career"},{"t":302.8,"txt":"choice I made. It uh it puts a big smile"},{"t":305.8,"txt":"on my face and I uh I really like coming"},{"t":308.5,"txt":"to work every day, learning new things"},{"t":310.2,"txt":"every day. So I look forward to doing"},{"t":312.5,"txt":"this for a very long time and getting"},{"t":314.2,"txt":"better and better at my"},{"t":318.1,"txt":"job. To become a journeyman milright,"},{"t":321.1,"txt":"you must find an employer who's willing"},{"t":323,"txt":"to train an apprentice. To earn a"},{"t":325.3,"txt":"journeyman certificate in the milright"},{"t":327,"txt":"trade, you will apprentice for four"},{"t":329.1,"txt":"12-month periods, including on the job"},{"t":331.6,"txt":"training and technical training. in each"},{"t":334.2,"txt":"period. If the milright trade interests"},{"t":336.8,"txt":"you, there's more information available,"},{"t":339,"txt":"including educational requirements and"},{"t":341.1,"txt":"salary ranges in the occupational"},{"t":343.1,"txt":"profiles on Alice. You may also be"},{"t":345.7,"txt":"interested in the related trades of"},{"t":347.2,"txt":"machinist or welder. Learn more on the"},{"t":350.2,"txt":"Alice website and make the most of your"},{"t":352.4,"txt":"future. Visit us at alice.alberta.ca."}],"words":[{"t":10.08,"w":"If"},{"t":10.32,"w":"you"},{"t":10.48,"w":"have"},{"t":10.639,"w":"good"},{"t":10.96,"w":"coordination"},{"t":11.519,"w":"and"},{"t":11.759,"w":"strength,"},{"t":12.4,"w":"are"},{"t":12.639,"w":"good"},{"t":12.8,"w":"at"},{"t":13.04,"w":"visualizing"},{"t":13.679,"w":"things"},{"t":13.92,"w":"from"},{"t":14.24,"w":"drawings"},{"t":14.559,"w":"or"},{"t":14.88,"w":"plans,"},{"t":15.36,"w":"and"},{"t":15.599,"w":"like"},{"t":15.839,"w":"to"},{"t":16,"w":"troubleshoot,"},{"t":16.88,"w":"you"},{"t":17.119,"w":"might"},{"t":17.359,"w":"be"},{"t":17.52,"w":"interested"},{"t":17.84,"w":"in"},{"t":18.08,"w":"becoming"},{"t":18.4,"w":"a"},{"t":18.84,"w":"milright."},{"t":19.84,"w":"Milrightes"},{"t":20.48,"w":"install"},{"t":20.88,"w":"and"},{"t":21.199,"w":"maintain"},{"t":21.76,"w":"stationary"},{"t":22.4,"w":"industrial"},{"t":22.96,"w":"machinery"},{"t":23.439,"w":"and"},{"t":23.76,"w":"mechanical"},{"t":24.24,"w":"equipment."},{"t":25.279,"w":"They"},{"t":25.519,"w":"may"},{"t":25.76,"w":"work"},{"t":25.92,"w":"in"},{"t":26.24,"w":"factories,"},{"t":27.039,"w":"production"},{"t":27.519,"w":"plants,"},{"t":27.92,"w":"or"},{"t":28.24,"w":"recreational"},{"t":29.08,"w":"facilities."},{"t":30.08,"w":"We"},{"t":30.24,"w":"talked"},{"t":30.48,"w":"to"},{"t":30.56,"w":"a"},{"t":30.72,"w":"milright"},{"t":31.199,"w":"to"},{"t":31.439,"w":"find"},{"t":31.599,"w":"out"},{"t":31.76,"w":"more."},{"t":33.2,"w":"I'm"},{"t":33.44,"w":"Benjamin"},{"t":33.84,"w":"Cosman."},{"t":34.32,"w":"I'm"},{"t":34.399,"w":"a"},{"t":34.559,"w":"milright."},{"t":35.44,"w":"A"},{"t":35.6,"w":"milright's"},{"t":36.16,"w":"a"},{"t":36.399,"w":"rotating"},{"t":36.88,"w":"equipment"},{"t":37.28,"w":"specialist."},{"t":38.16,"w":"They"},{"t":38.399,"w":"can"},{"t":38.559,"w":"work"},{"t":38.719,"w":"on"},{"t":38.879,"w":"conveyor"},{"t":39.28,"w":"belts,"},{"t":39.68,"w":"compressors,"},{"t":40.399,"w":"centrifugal"},{"t":41.04,"w":"pumps,"},{"t":41.68,"w":"anything"},{"t":4